The chemistry is easier than people tell you. The discipline is harder.

## The setup

A changing bag, a tank, three bottles and a thermometer. The whole kit fits in a
shoebox and lives under the sink between rolls.

## The wait

Developing your own film reintroduces a delay the digital world spent twenty
years removing. That delay is not a bug. It is the last place left where you do
not get to see the result immediately, and you are better for it.
